    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u1edf l\u1ea1i trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng; n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n, g\u1eedi c\u00f9ng th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn trung t\u00e2m th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o c\u1ee7a \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ebfn Telegram. Kh\u00f4ng b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
