    "Aboneli\u011fin hemen sona erer ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n k\u1ebft th\u00fac ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c v\u00e0 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb th\u00eam b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n n\u00e0o.", // EN: Your subscription ends immediately and no further payment is taken.
