    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd \u2014 m\u1ecdi t\u00ednh n\u0103ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111ang mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed. NEXUS+ s\u1eafp ra m\u1eaft.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
