    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, anahtar ve enerji \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "\u1ed4 c\u1eafm, c\u00f4ng t\u1eafc v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u00f4ng minh", // EN: Smart plugs, switches and energy products
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "L\u01b0u tr\u1eef nhanh cho c\u00e1c \u1ed5 c\u1eafm v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Mang c\u00e1c \u1ed5 c\u1eafm th\u00f4ng minh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb ti\u00eau th\u1ee5 n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1ea1i v\u1edbi nhau \u1edf m\u1ed9t n\u01a1i. T\u1ea1o c\u00e1c h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng sinh th\u00e1i theo l\u1ecbch.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "T\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3ng ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd c\u00e1c \u1ed5 c\u1eafm th\u00f4ng minh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb ti\u00eau th\u1ee5 n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. Th\u00eam ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng t\u1eaft nhanh, h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 sinh th\u00e1i, ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m theo l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 t\u00f3m t\u1eaft s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
