    "Ana ekran\u0131n sa\u011f \u00fcst\u00fcndeki + butonuna dokunun ve \"Tara\" ile cihaz\u0131n QR kodunu okutun ya da kurulum kodunu elle girin.": "Ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o n\u00fat + \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i c\u1ee7a m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 qu\u00e9t m\u00e3 QR c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u1edbi \"Qu\u00e9t\", ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.", // EN: Tap the + button at the top right of the home screen and scan the device's QR code with "Scan", or enter the setup code manually.
