    "Bu uygulamada eklenebilen cihaz t\u00fcr\u00fc bulunamad\u0131.": "Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 th\u00eam lo\u1ea1i thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng n\u00e0y.", // EN: No device types can be added in this app.
