    "Ara\u00e7 ekran\u0131nda NEXUS simgesine dokun; favori kartlar\u0131n otomatik gelir.": "Ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng NEXUS tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh xe; c\u00e1c th\u1ebb y\u00eau th\u00edch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng.", // EN: Tap the NEXUS icon on the car screen; your favorite cards appear automatically.
    "Ara\u00e7 ekran\u0131nda h\u0131zl\u0131 kontroller": "\u0110i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n nhanh tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh xe", // EN: Quick controls on the car screen
