    "\u00dcyeler aras\u0131 mesajla\u015fma hen\u00fcz yok; \u00fcyeleri ve izinlerini Aile ekran\u0131ndan y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Nh\u1eafn tin gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean hi\u1ec7n ch\u01b0a kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng; b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh Gia \u0111\u00ecnh.", // EN: Messaging between members is not available yet; you can manage members and their permissions on the Family screen.
