    "NEXUS+ abonelikleri yak\u0131nda a\u00e7\u0131lacak.": "C\u00e1c g\u00f3i NEXUS+ s\u1ebd s\u1edbm m\u1edf.", // EN: NEXUS+ subscriptions will open soon.
    "Dokun \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y", // EN: Tap to run
