    "Beyaz e\u015fya ve b\u00fcy\u00fck ev cihazlar\u0131": "H\u00e0ng tr\u1eafng v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb gia d\u1ee5ng l\u1edbn", // EN: White goods and large appliances
