    "Cihaz adresi ge\u00e7ersiz. Taramay\u0131 yeniden ba\u015flat.": "\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7. H\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i.", // EN: The device address is invalid. Start the scan again.
