    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "T\u1eaft t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 nh\u00f3m \u0111\u00e8n \u0111ang b\u1eadt \u1edf nh\u00e0.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "\u1ede nh\u00e0 v\u00e0 \u0111i v\u1eafng", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "\u0110i v\u1eafng", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Khi \u0111i v\u1eafng", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111\u00e8n trong nh\u00e0 b\u1ea1n theo t\u1eebng ph\u00f2ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch. B\u1eadt/t\u1eaft, \u0111\u1ed9 s\u00e1ng, nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 m\u00e0u v\u00e0 ph\u00edm t\u1eaft c\u1ea3nh nhanh trong m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Cung c\u1ea5p l\u1ec7nh c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n, t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a nhanh v\u00e0 g\u1ee3i \u00fd \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng minh d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb trong nh\u00e0.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "T\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ti\u1ec7n nghi kh\u00ed h\u1eadu qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00f2a v\u00e0 b\u1ed9 \u0111i\u1ec1u nhi\u1ec7t trong nh\u00e0 b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n. Bao g\u1ed3m \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9, ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 nhanh, ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng theo ph\u00f2ng.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i l\u00e0 g\u00ec?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Ra kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "C\u1ea3nh Ra kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Ki\u1ec3m tra n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 an ninh khi b\u1ea1n r\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "Ra ngo\u00e0i", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "R\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Ki\u1ec3m tra R\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "C\u1ea3nh R\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "T\u00f3m t\u1eaft R\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t R\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "T\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi r\u1eddi nh\u00e0 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u00f2n b\u1eadt, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh. Th\u00eam c\u00e1c n\u00fat t\u1eaft nhanh v\u00e0 k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Ki\u1ec3m tra c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u00f2n b\u1eadt, kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong m\u1ed9t quy tr\u00ecnh khi r\u1eddi nh\u00e0.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u00f2n b\u1eadt, kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh khi r\u1eddi nh\u00e0.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Xem \u0111\u00e8n, \u1ed5 c\u1eafm, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00f2a v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt c\u00f2n b\u1eadt tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi r\u1eddi nh\u00e0, tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n. T\u1eadp h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc t\u1eaft nhanh v\u00e0 k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t quy tr\u00ecnh.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "H\u00e3y th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3m tra cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1ea1n ra kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "T\u1eaft \u0111\u00e8n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng sau khi r\u1eddi nh\u00e0", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "T\u1eaft \u0111\u00e8n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng sau khi b\u1ea1n r\u1eddi nh\u00e0 v\u00e0 b\u1eadt l\u1ea1i khi b\u1ea1n quay v\u1ec1.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eaft \u0111\u00e8n sau khi b\u1ea1n ra kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0 v\u00e0 b\u1eadt l\u1ea1i khi b\u1ea1n v\u1ec1.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "T\u1eaft \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00f2a t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng khi kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ai \u1edf nh\u00e0 v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ti\u00eau th\u1ee5 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1eaft ngu\u1ed3n c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i ch\u1edd v\u00e0o th\u1eddi gian b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0o ban \u0111\u00eam.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Khi r\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi nh\u00e0", // EN: When leaving home
