    "Listeye ekle ya da not yaz\u2026": "Th\u00eam v\u00e0o danh s\u00e1ch ho\u1eb7c vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t ghi ch\u00fa \u2026", // EN: Add to the list or write a note…
    "T\u00fcr de\u011fi\u015ftir: liste maddesi / not": "Chuy\u1ec3n lo\u1ea1i: m\u1ee5c danh s\u00e1ch / ghi ch\u00fa", // EN: Switch type: list item / note
