    "Hen\u00fcz enerji tasarrufu destekleyen bir cihaz\u0131n yok, l\u00fctfen \u00f6ncelikle ekle.": "B\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng; vui l\u00f2ng th\u00eam m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc.", // EN: You don't have a device that supports energy saving yet; please add one first.
