    "Kilit, kamera veya sens\u00f6r ekledi\u011finde tarama onlar\u0131 da kontrol eder.": "Khi b\u1ea1n th\u00eam kh\u00f3a, camera ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn, qu\u00e9t c\u0169ng ki\u1ec3m tra ch\u00fang.", // EN: When you add a lock, camera or sensor, the scan checks those too.
    "Kilit, kap\u0131 zili ve giri\u015f \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcmleri": "Kh\u00f3a, chu\u00f4ng c\u1eeda v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p ra v\u00e0o", // EN: Locks, doorbells and entry solutions
