    "L\u00fctfen alan\u0131 doldurun.": "Vui l\u00f2ng \u0111i\u1ec1n v\u00e0o tr\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e0y.", // EN: Please fill in the field.
    "L\u00fctfen cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131nda oldu\u011fundan emin olun.": "Vui l\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111ang b\u1eadt v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi.", // EN: Please make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.
    "L\u00fctfen cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin olun.": "Vui l\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111ang \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 gh\u00e9p n\u1ed1i.", // EN: Please make sure the device is in pairing mode.
