    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Vi\u1ec7c th\u00eam thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb Matter c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 b\u1ed9 \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n Matter, m\u00e0 NEXUS ch\u01b0a cung c\u1ea5p. N\u1ebfu thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i qua Wi-Fi, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam n\u00f3 t\u1eeb m\u1ea1ng c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 IP.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
