    "NEXUS AI G\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm Modu": "Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb AI NEXUS", // EN: NEXUS AI Appearance Mode
    "NEXUS AI Masa\u00fcst\u00fc": "AI NEXUS tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n", // EN: NEXUS AI Desktop
    "NEXUS AI Puanlar\u0131": "\u0110i\u1ec3m AI NEXUS", // EN: NEXUS AI Points
    "NEXUS AI ak\u0131ll\u0131 ev kontrol\u00fc": "\u0110i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n nh\u00e0 th\u00f4ng minh AI NEXUS", // EN: NEXUS AI smart home control
    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "AI NEXUS h\u1ecdc th\u00f3i quen c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 bi\u1ebfn ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u00e0nh kh\u00f4ng gian s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ri\u00eang cho b\u1ea1n.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
    "NEXUS AI ile her \u015feyi olu\u015fturun": "T\u1ea1o b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec v\u1edbi AI NEXUS", // EN: Create anything with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile sohbet et": "Tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n v\u1edbi AI NEXUS", // EN: Chat with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme puan kullan\u0131r. Puanlar her g\u00fcn yenilenir.": "M\u1ed7i cu\u1ed9c tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n v\u1edbi AI NEXUS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111i\u1ec3m. \u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m m\u1edbi m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.", // EN: Each conversation with NEXUS AI uses points. Points renew every day.
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131 nedir?": "\u0110i\u1ec3m AI NEXUS l\u00e0 g\u00ec?", // EN: What are NEXUS AI points?
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "\u0110i\u1ec3m AI NEXUS c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m m\u1edbi m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y; hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i m\u1ecdi t\u00ednh n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ec1u mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
