    "NEXUS AI, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda": "AI NEXUS, trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n", // EN: NEXUS AI, in the desktop app
