    "NEXUS Haz\u0131r": "NEXUS S\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng", // EN: NEXUS Ready
    "NEXUS HomeKit K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc": "C\u1ea7u NEXUS HomeKit", // EN: NEXUS HomeKit Bridge
    "NEXUS Y\u00f6nlendiriliyor...": "Chuy\u1ec3n h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn NEXUS...", // EN: Redirecting to NEXUS...
    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham gia b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 n\u00e0y trong \"Tham gia m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0\" b\u00ean trong NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Ch\u1ea1y c\u00e1c k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n NEXUS c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1ecdng n\u00f3i v\u1edbi Siri ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS \u01b0u ti\u00ean c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9: d\u1eef li\u1ec7u thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u1edf l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0y, l\u1ec7nh thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111i th\u1eb3ng qua m\u1ea1ng c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 g\u00ec \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chia s\u1ebb v\u1edbi b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
