    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i NEXUS v\u1edbi c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111\u00e2u.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "C\u00e1c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y hi\u1ec7n ch\u01b0a kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Home Assistant t\u1eeb ph\u1ea7n T\u00edch H\u1ee3p.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
