    "NEXUS+ Y\u0131ll\u0131k": "NEXUS+ H\u00e0ng N\u0103m", // EN: NEXUS+ Yearly
    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi ba\u015flat\u0131ld\u0131": "\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd NEXUS+ \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription started
    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi iptal edildi": "\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd NEXUS+ \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription cancelled
    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ hi\u1ec7n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n. Vi\u1ec7c th\u00eam thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb, k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 NEXUS AI hi\u1ec7n \u0111ang ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed; ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o cho b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y khi c\u00e1c g\u00f3i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
    "NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda": "NEXUS+ s\u1eafp ra m\u1eaft", // EN: NEXUS+ coming soon
    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "NEXUS t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n m\u00e3 b\u00ean trong khung v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u gh\u00e9p n\u1ed1i.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
    "NEXUS_CARD_CATALOG tan\u0131ml\u0131 de\u011fil. data.js y\u00fcklendi mi?": "NEXUS_CARD_CATALOG ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u.js \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea3i ch\u01b0a?", // EN: NEXUS_CARD_CATALOG is not defined. Was data.js loaded?
