    "Pi\u015firme sonras\u0131 karbonmonoksit seviyesi hafif y\u00fckselmi\u015f. Pencereyi a\u00e7man\u0131z \u00f6nerilir.": "N\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ed9 carbon monoxide t\u0103ng nh\u1eb9 sau khi n\u1ea5u \u0103n. Khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb m\u1edf c\u1eeda s\u1ed5.", // EN: Carbon monoxide rose slightly after cooking. Opening a window is recommended.
