    "QR okunamazsa, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki manuel ekleme se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle kodu elle girin.": "N\u1ebfu m\u00e3 QR kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc, nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1eb1ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi.", // EN: If the QR can't be read, enter the code manually with the manual option below.
    "QR tarama, kurulum kodu ve manuel katalog ile cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ger\u00e7ek ak\u0131\u015f \u00fczerinden ekleyebilirsin.": "B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch qu\u00e9t t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng, m\u00e3 QR, m\u00e3 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp ho\u1eb7c danh m\u1ee5c th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.", // EN: You can add your devices by automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
