    "S\u0131k Sorulan Sorular": "C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p", // EN: Frequently Asked Questions
    "TV Ortam I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131": "\u00c1nh s\u00e1ng M\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng TV", // EN: TV Ambient Light
    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "T\u1ea1o c\u1ea3nh r\u1ea1p chi\u1ebfu phim m\u1edd cho ph\u00f2ng TV.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "T\u1ea1o ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ea1p chi\u1ebfu phim cho TV v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb media. Bao g\u1ed3m b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u phim, \u00e2m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ph\u00edm t\u1eaft gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb ph\u00e2n t\u00e2m.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "B\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea1m cho TV v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb media.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TV, loa v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p TV, h\u1ed9p truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e8n m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng trong m\u1ed9t h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng. Gi\u00fap d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\u00e1c c\u1ea3nh kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng phim, ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ban \u0111\u00eam v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb ph\u00e2n t\u00e2m.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "T\u1ea5t nhi\u00ean! T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n th\u00f4ng minh tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi cho b\u1ea1n. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cung c\u1ea5p cho t\u00f4i m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i chi ti\u1ebft kh\u00f4ng? V\u00ed d\u1ee5: \"B\u1eadt m\u00e1y pha c\u00e0 ph\u00ea khi t\u00f4i th\u1ee9c d\u1eady\" ho\u1eb7c \"H\u1ea1 \u0111\u00e8n xu\u1ed1ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n khi t\u00f4i xem phim\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
