    "Taray\u0131c\u0131da otomatik a\u011f taramas\u0131 yap\u0131lamaz. Cihaz adresini elle gir ya da masa\u00fcst\u00fc/telefon uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan.": "Qu\u00e9t m\u1ea1ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00f4ng kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng trong tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t. Nh\u1eadp \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh/\u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.", // EN: Automatic network scanning isn't available in the browser. Enter the device address manually or use the desktop/phone app.
