    "\u0130ptal \u015fu an tamamlanamad\u0131. Biraz sonra yeniden dene.": "Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t. H\u00e3y th\u1eed l\u1ea1i sau v\u00e0i ph\u00fat.", // EN: Cancellation could not be completed. Try again in a moment.
