    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Vui l\u00f2ng nh\u1eadp email h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u1edbi email n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ed3n t\u1ea1i. Vui l\u00f2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Li\u00ean k\u1ebft n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ebft h\u1ea1n ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7. Vui l\u00f2ng th\u1eed l\u1ea1i.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e1m m\u00e2y b\u1ecb v\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a trong phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n n\u00e0y; m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "N\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, m\u1ed9t li\u00ean k\u1ebft \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi. Vui l\u00f2ng ki\u1ec3m tra h\u1ed9p th\u01b0 \u0111\u1ebfn (v\u00e0 th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c spam).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n th\u1eed. Vui l\u00f2ng th\u1eed l\u1ea1i sau m\u1ed9t ph\u00fat.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 g\u1eedi li\u00ean k\u1ebft.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "G\u1eedi l\u1ea1i", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "M\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp ngay b\u00e2y gi\u1edd.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.", // EN: Enter your current password.
    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "M\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "M\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u m\u1edbi ph\u1ea3i kh\u00e1c v\u1edbi m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u c\u0169.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y phi\u00ean l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c. \u0110\u0103ng xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp l\u1ea1i.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
    "\u015eifre g\u00fcncellenemedi.": "Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u.", // EN: Could not update the password.
    "Davet e-postas\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "\u0110ang g\u1eedi email m\u1eddi\u2026", // EN: Sending invitation email…
    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Email n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n; h\u1ecd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham gia b\u1eb1ng m\u00e3.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
    "Ev sahibi yetkileri kapat\u0131lamaz": "Quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb t\u1eaft", // EN: Owner permissions cannot be turned off
