    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Chi ph\u00ed \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n. Gi\u00e1 n\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0y.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
