    "Shelly Door/Window Kap\u0131 ve Pencere Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn C\u1eeda/ C\u1eeda s\u1ed5 Shelly", // EN: Shelly Door/Window Contact Sensor
    "Shelly Flood Su Bask\u0131n\u0131 Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn R\u00f2 r\u1ec9 N\u01b0\u1edbc Shelly", // EN: Shelly Flood Leak Sensor
    "Shelly Smoke Duman Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "M\u00e1y b\u00e1o Kh\u00f3i Shelly", // EN: Shelly Smoke Detector
    "Yerel \u015fifreli HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 TP-Link hesab\u0131 e-postas\u0131 + \u015fifresiyle, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller (kamera ve enerji \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc hen\u00fcz yok)": "HTTP m\u00e3 h\u00f3a c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (KLAP) \u2014 v\u1edbi email + m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TP-Link c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n; ph\u00edch c\u1eafm, c\u00f4ng t\u1eafc v\u00e0 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e8n (camera v\u00e0 \u0111o n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng hi\u1ec7n ch\u01b0a kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng)", // EN: Local encrypted HTTP (KLAP) — with your TP-Link account email + password, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs (camera and energy metering not available yet)
