    "Home Assistant Hareket Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn Chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Motion Sensor
    "Home Assistant Kap\u0131 ve Pencere Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn C\u1eeda & C\u1eeda s\u1ed5 Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Door & Window Sensor
    "Home Assistant S\u0131cakl\u0131k ve Nem Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn Nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 & \u0110\u1ed9 \u1ea9m Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Temperature & Humidity Sensor
    "Home Assistant Su S\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn R\u00f2 r\u1ec9 N\u01b0\u1edbc Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Water Leak Sensor
    "Home Assistant Duman Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "M\u00e1y b\u00e1o Kh\u00f3i Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Smoke Detector
    "Home Assistant Gaz ve CO Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "M\u00e1y b\u00e1o Kh\u00ed & CO Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Gas & CO Detector
    "Home Assistant Hava Kalitesi Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng Kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Air Quality Sensor
    "Yerel LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u015fifreli TCP) \u2014 \u00fccretsiz Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131nan cihaz kimli\u011fi + yerel anahtarla, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller": "M\u1ea1ng LAN c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (3.3 / 3.4, TCP m\u00e3 h\u00f3a) \u2014 v\u1edbi ID thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb + kh\u00f3a c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 t\u1eeb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Tuya IoT mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n; \u1ed5 c\u1eafm, c\u00f4ng t\u1eafc v\u00e0 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e8n", // EN: Local LAN (3.3 / 3.4, encrypted TCP) — with the device ID + local key from a free Tuya IoT account, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs
    "Tuya Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar / R\u00f6le": "C\u00f4ng t\u1eafc / R\u01a1 le Tuya Smart", // EN: Tuya Smart Switch / Relay
    "eWeLink DIY modu (cihazda DIY a\u00e7\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131) \u2014 \u00e7ok kanall\u0131 modellerde her kanal ayr\u0131 cihaz": "Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 DIY eWeLink (DIY ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1eadt tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb) \u2014 tr\u00ean c\u00e1c m\u1eabu nhi\u1ec1u k\u00eanh, m\u1ed7i k\u00eanh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb ri\u00eang", // EN: eWeLink DIY mode (DIY must be enabled on the device) — on multi-channel models each channel is a separate device
    "Sonoff BASICR3 R\u00f6le": "R\u01a1 le Sonoff BASICR3", // EN: Sonoff BASICR3 Relay
