    "Sonoff 4CHPROR3 4 Kanall\u0131 R\u00f6le": "R\u01a1 le 4 k\u00eanh Sonoff 4CHPROR3", // EN: Sonoff 4CHPROR3 4-Channel Relay
    "Yerel UDP \u2014 masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; yerle\u015fik sahneler dahil": "UDP c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 \u2014 trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n; bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c c\u1ea3nh d\u1ef1ng s\u1eb5n", // EN: Local UDP — in the desktop app; built-in scenes included
    "WiZ A60 Renkli Ampul": "\u0110\u00e8n WiZ A60 m\u00e0u", // EN: WiZ A60 Colour Bulb
    "WiZ I\u015f\u0131k \u015eeridi": "D\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e8n WiZ", // EN: WiZ Light Strip
    "Yerel Open API (ba\u011flant\u0131 noktas\u0131 16021); g\u00fc\u00e7 d\u00fc\u011fmesiyle e\u015fle\u015ftirme gerekir": "API m\u1edf c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (c\u1ed5ng 16021); c\u1ea7n gh\u00e9p \u0111\u00f4i v\u1edbi n\u00fat ngu\u1ed3n", // EN: Local Open API (port 16021); pairing with the power button is required
    "Nanoleaf I\u015f\u0131k Panelleri / Shapes": "Nanoleaf Light Panels / Shapes", // EN: Nanoleaf Light Panels / Shapes
    "Yerel UDP \u2014 masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda": "UDP c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 \u2014 trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n", // EN: Local UDP — in the desktop app
    "LIFX Z LED \u015eerit": "D\u1ea3i LED LIFX Z", // EN: LIFX Z LED Strip
    "Yerel UDP (Govee Home'da LAN Control a\u00e7\u0131k olmal\u0131) \u2014 masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda": "UDP c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (Ph\u1ea3i b\u1eadt LAN Control trong Govee Home) \u2014 trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0n", // EN: Local UDP (LAN Control must be enabled in Govee Home) — in the desktop app
