    " A command was sent over your local network to 1 device.": "M\u1ed9t l\u1ec7nh \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi qua m\u1ea1ng c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ebfn 1 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb.", // EN: A command was sent over your local network to 1 device.
    "\u26a0 The command did not reach {0} \u2014 make sure it is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.": "\u26a0 L\u1ec7nh kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c {0} \u2014 h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111ang b\u1eadt v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi.", // EN: ⚠ The command did not reach {0} — make sure it is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.
    "You have {0} devices at home.": "B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 {0} thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u1edf nh\u00e0.", // EN: You have {0} devices at home.
    "You have {0} device at home.": "B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 {0} thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb trong nh\u00e0.", // EN: You have {0} device at home.
    "Right now these are on: {0}.": "Hi\u1ec7n gi\u1edd nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111ang b\u1eadt: {0}.", // EN: Right now these are on: {0}.
    " and a few more": "v\u00e0 v\u00e0i thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u1eefa", // EN: and a few more
    "Nothing is on right now, the house is quiet.": "Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o b\u1eadt, c\u0103n nh\u00e0 y\u00ean t\u0129nh.", // EN: Nothing is on right now, the house is quiet.
    "These need your attention: {0}.": "Nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb sau c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n: {0}.", // EN: These need your attention: {0}.
    "{0} devices": "{0} thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb", // EN: {0} devices
    "{0} device": "{0} thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb", // EN: {0} device
    "Target temperature": "Nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau", // EN: Target temperature
