    "Which device should I turn on? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o t\u00f4i n\u00ean b\u1eadt? S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb, t\u00ean ph\u00f2ng ho\u1eb7c lo\u1ea1i nh\u01b0 \"\u0111\u00e8n\" ho\u1eb7c \"\u1ed5 c\u1eafm\". C\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 gh\u00e9p n\u1ed1i: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn on? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
    "Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o t\u00f4i n\u00ean t\u1eaft? S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb, m\u1ed9t ph\u00f2ng ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1i nh\u01b0 '\u0111\u00e8n' ho\u1eb7c '\u1ed5 c\u1eafm'. C\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e3 gh\u00e9p n\u1ed1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
